{"id":"n16481-1-7","stage":3,"title":"쌍 · 双","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n16481-1-7-1","ko":"이번 게임은 어떻게 진행됩니까?","zh":"这次游戏要怎么进行呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이번","meaning":"这次，这回","explanation":"이번：这次，这回","readings":[{"term":"이번","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29737","senseId":"1","lemma":"이번","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이번","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3"}},{"text":"게임은","meaning":"游戏，比赛","explanation":"게임：游戏，比赛；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"게임","audio":"/audio/252ac990d27ebe080959.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57276","senseId":"1","lemma":"게임","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"게임은","audio":"/audio/d9cf83882979e4b0cbec.mp3"}},{"text":"어떻게","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어떻게","audio":"/audio/64e493d09f1b306ade0c.mp3"}},{"text":"진행됩니까?","meaning":"进行，进展","explanation":"진행되다：进行，进展；ㅂ니까：正式礼貌的疑问句末。","readings":[{"term":"진행되다","audio":"/audio/b216e1c5aba49ada93c8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29756","senseId":"2","lemma":"진행되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"진행됩니까","audio":"/audio/d656af5f6002ee7b019a.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"da78d4146f0588e8","term":"이번","zh":"这次，这回","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3","entryId":"29737","definition":"马上到来的顺序；或指刚过去的顺序。","pronunciation":["이번"]},{"id":"252ac990d27ebe08","term":"게임","zh":"游戏，比赛","audio":"/audio/252ac990d27ebe080959.mp3","entryId":"57276","definition":"制定规则、分出胜负的玩法。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"e0a8c114a77e0814","term":"어떻다","zh":"怎么样","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3","entryId":"70482","definition":"想法、感觉、状态或境况等成为什么状况。","pronunciation":["어떠타"]},{"id":"b